{"seq":3,"slug":"federated-governance-interop","title":"联邦治理与互操作性标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/principles/federated-governance-interop","wordCount":1499,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"联邦治理与互操作性标准\">联邦治理与互操作性标准</h1><p>联邦计算治理是数据网格能够规模化的关键机制。它解决的核心矛盾是：既要给每个领域足够的自治权以保证敏捷性，又要确保全局一致性使跨域数据可以互操作。本文讲解联邦治理的架构设计和互操作性标准的建立方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"联邦治理架构\">联邦治理架构</h2><h3 id=\"治理层级模型\">治理层级模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐&#10;│              全局治理层 (Global Governance)            │&#10;│  跨域治理委员会 = 领域代表 + 平台团队 + 法务/合规        │&#10;│                                                      │&#10;│  定义：全局策略 / 互操作标准 / 合规要求                 │&#10;│  机制：策略即代码 → 自动化检查 → 不阻塞领域流水线         │&#10;└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘&#10;             │ 全局策略下发（Policy Distribution）&#10;             ▼&#10;┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐&#10;│              领域本地层 (Domain Local)                 │&#10;│  Order Domain | User Domain | Payment Domain | ...   │&#10;│                                                      │&#10;│  自主决定：存储格式 / SLO 数值 / 内部建模 / 发布频率     │&#10;│  遵守：全局策略 / 注册到全局目录 / 使用统一发现接口       │&#10;└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│              全局治理层 (Global Governance)            │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  跨域治理委员会 = 领域代表 + 平台团队 + 法务/合规        │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│                                                      │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  定义：全局策略 / 互操作标准 / 合规要求                 │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  机制：策略即代码 → 自动化检查 → 不阻塞领域流水线         │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             │ 全局策略下发（Policy Distribution）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│              领域本地层 (Domain Local)                 │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  Order Domain | User Domain | Payment Domain | ...   │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│                                                      │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  自主决定：存储格式 / SLO 数值 / 内部建模 / 发布频率     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  遵守：全局策略 / 注册到全局目录 / 使用统一发现接口       │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"跨域治理委员会-federated-governance-council\">跨域治理委员会（Federated Governance Council）</h3><p>委员会由以下角色组成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>领域代表</strong>：每个数据领域选出一名 Data Product Owner 参与</li>\n<li><strong>平台团队代表</strong>：提供技术可行性判断</li>\n<li><strong>合规/法务代表</strong>：确保监管要求被纳入全局策略</li>\n<li><strong>首席数据官（CDO）或代理</strong>：最终决策权</li>\n</ul>\n<p>委员会职责：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>制定和修订全局数据策略</li>\n<li>维护全局数据词汇表</li>\n<li>仲裁跨域数据争议</li>\n<li>评审数据产品的互操作性合规</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>不应由委员会做的事</strong>：每个领域数据产品的技术实现细节、具体 SLO 数值、内部 schema 设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"策略即代码-policy-as-code\">策略即代码（Policy as Code）</h2><p>将治理策略编码化是确保一致执行的核心机制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"策略类型与编码方式\">策略类型与编码方式</h3><p><strong>结构策略</strong>：关于数据格式和 schema 的规范</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# global-policies/structure.yaml&#10;schema_requirements:&#10;  timestamp_format: &#39;ISO8601&#39; # 所有时间字段使用 ISO 8601&#10;  id_encoding: &#39;UUID v4&#39; # 所有 ID 字段使用 UUID&#10;  nullability_explicit: true # schema 必须明确标注 nullable 字段&#10;  version_field_required: true # 数据产品输出必须包含 _version 字段&#10;&#10;naming_conventions:&#10;  event_naming: &#39;{aggregate}_{past_tense_verb}&#39; # order_created, payment_processed&#10;  table_naming: &#39;snake_case&#39;&#10;  column_naming: &#39;snake_case&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># global-policies/structure.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">schema_requirements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  timestamp_format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ISO8601'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 所有时间字段使用 ISO 8601</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  id_encoding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UUID v4'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 所有 ID 字段使用 UUID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  nullability_explicit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # schema 必须明确标注 nullable 字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  version_field_required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 数据产品输出必须包含 _version 字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">naming_conventions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  event_naming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{aggregate}_{past_tense_verb}'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # order_created, payment_processed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  table_naming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'snake_case'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  column_naming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'snake_case'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>安全策略</strong>：关于数据访问控制的规范</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# global-policies/security.yaml&#10;data_classification:&#10;  PII_fields:&#10;    - pattern: &#39;email&#39;&#10;    - pattern: &#39;*_phone&#39;&#10;    - pattern: &#39;ssn&#39;&#10;    - pattern: &#39;birth_date&#39;&#10;  enforcement:&#10;    - PII 字段必须在 schema 中标注 classification: PII&#10;    - 未标注 classification 的 PII 字段将触发 CI 检查失败&#10;&#10;access_control:&#10;  default_policy: &#39;deny_all&#39; # 默认拒绝所有访问&#10;  approval_required_for: [&#39;PII&#39;, &#39;CONFIDENTIAL&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># global-policies/security.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">data_classification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  PII_fields</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">pattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'email'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">pattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'*_phone'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">pattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ssn'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">pattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'birth_date'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  enforcement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">PII 字段必须在 schema 中标注 classification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PII</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">未标注 classification 的 PII 字段将触发 CI 检查失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">access_control</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  default_policy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'deny_all'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 默认拒绝所有访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  approval_required_for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PII'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CONFIDENTIAL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>合规策略</strong>：关于数据保留和处理的规范</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# global-policies/compliance.yaml&#10;data_retention:&#10;  PII:&#10;    max_retention_days: 730 # GDPR 要求&#10;    deletion_propagation: true # 删除请求必须传播到所有下游&#10;  TRANSACTIONAL:&#10;    min_retention_days: 2555 # 财务合规 7 年保留&#10;&#10;lineage_required: true # 所有数据产品必须注册血缘信息\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># global-policies/compliance.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">data_retention</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  PII</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    max_retention_days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">730</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # GDPR 要求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    deletion_propagation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 删除请求必须传播到所有下游</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  TRANSACTIONAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    min_retention_days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2555</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 财务合规 7 年保留</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">lineage_required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 所有数据产品必须注册血缘信息</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"策略执行流水线\">策略执行流水线</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"数据产品 CI/CD Pipeline&#10;─────────────────────────────────────────────────────&#10;Push to repo&#10;    │&#10;    ▼&#10;[Schema Validation]&#10;    检查 schema 是否符合全局结构策略&#10;    - 时间戳格式检查&#10;    - PII 字段分类标注检查&#10;    - 版本字段存在检查&#10;    │ Pass&#10;    ▼&#10;[Security Policy Check]&#10;    - 访问控制配置检查&#10;    - PII 字段加密配置检查&#10;    │ Pass&#10;    ▼&#10;[Compliance Check]&#10;    - 数据保留策略配置检查&#10;    - 血缘注册检查&#10;    │ Pass&#10;    ▼&#10;[Deploy Data Product]&#10;    注册到全局数据目录&#10;    发布 schema 到 Schema Registry\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>数据产品 CI/CD Pipeline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>─────────────────────────────────────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Push to repo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Schema Validation]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    检查 schema 是否符合全局结构策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - 时间戳格式检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - PII 字段分类标注检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - 版本字段存在检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │ Pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Security Policy Check]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - 访问控制配置检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - PII 字段加密配置检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │ Pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Compliance Check]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - 数据保留策略配置检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    - 血缘注册检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │ Pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Deploy Data Product]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    注册到全局数据目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    发布 schema 到 Schema Registry</span></span></code></pre></div><p>工具选择：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Open Policy Agent（OPA）</strong>：通用策略执行引擎，支持 Rego 语言编写策略</li>\n<li><strong>Great Expectations</strong>：数据质量策略的代码化工具</li>\n<li><strong>dbt tests</strong>：SQL 转换层的策略执行</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"互操作性标准\">互操作性标准</h2><p>互操作性是指不同领域的数据产品可以被统一消费，不需要为每个数据源编写特定适配代码。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规范模型-vs-防腐层-vs-共享内核\">规范模型 vs 防腐层 vs 共享内核</h3><p>解决跨域语义不一致的三种模式：</p>\n<p><strong>规范数据模型（Canonical Data Model）</strong>：定义全局统一的数据词汇表和核心实体模型，所有数据产品的输出必须映射到规范模型。</p>\n<p>优点：完全互操作，消费者只需学习一套模型\n缺点：规范模型维护成本高，变更难，易成为瓶颈</p>\n<p>适用：领域数量较少（&lt;10），核心实体模型相对稳定</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# canonical-model/entities/customer.yaml&#10;type: Customer&#10;canonical_id: customer_id&#10;fields:&#10;  customer_id:&#10;    type: UUID&#10;    description: &#39;全局唯一客户 ID&#39;&#10;  email:&#10;    type: string&#10;    classification: PII&#10;    description: &#39;主要联系邮箱&#39;&#10;  registration_at:&#10;    type: timestamp_tz&#10;    description: &#39;注册时间，ISO8601&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># canonical-model/entities/customer.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Customer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">canonical_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">customer_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fields</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  customer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UUID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'全局唯一客户 ID'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    classification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PII</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'主要联系邮箱'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  registration_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">timestamp_tz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'注册时间，ISO8601'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>防腐层（Anti-Corruption Layer）</strong>：在数据产品边界处做语义转换，消费者通过 ACL 获得统一视图，但各数据产品保留内部模型。</p>\n<p>优点：不干扰领域内部演进，领域自治性强\n缺点：每个消费关系都需要维护 ACL，维护成本随连接数增长</p>\n<p>适用：领域模型差异大，无法强制统一的情况</p>\n<p><strong>共享内核（Shared Kernel）</strong>：少量真正共享的实体（如 customer_id 的编码规范、currency_code 的枚举值）抽取到共享库，所有领域引用。</p>\n<p>优点：只共享真正需要共享的部分，减少耦合\n缺点：共享内核变更需要所有领域协同升级</p>\n<p>适用：大多数实际场景，与其他模式组合使用</p>\n<h3 id=\"实践推荐-分层互操作标准\">实践推荐：分层互操作标准</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"层级 1：语法标准（Syntactic Interoperability）&#10;  强制执行，无豁免&#10;  - 时间戳格式 = ISO 8601&#10;  - 文本编码 = UTF-8&#10;  - 数值精度规范（货币金额用 DECIMAL(19,4)）&#10;&#10;层级 2：结构标准（Structural Interoperability）&#10;  强制执行，极少豁免&#10;  - 数据产品必须有 _version、_created_at、_updated_at 元字段&#10;  - 事件型数据产品必须有 event_id、event_type、event_time&#10;&#10;层级 3：语义标准（Semantic Interoperability）&#10;  强烈建议，可豁免（需审批）&#10;  - 全局词汇表中定义的核心实体名称&#10;  - customer_id、order_id 等跨域 ID 的编码规范&#10;&#10;层级 4：行为标准（Behavioral Interoperability）&#10;  建议，领域自决&#10;  - SLO 定义格式（建议使用 OpenSLO 规范）&#10;  - 数据契约格式\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>层级 1：语法标准（Syntactic Interoperability）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  强制执行，无豁免</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 时间戳格式 = ISO 8601</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 文本编码 = UTF-8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 数值精度规范（货币金额用 DECIMAL(19,4)）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>层级 2：结构标准（Structural Interoperability）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  强制执行，极少豁免</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 数据产品必须有 _version、_created_at、_updated_at 元字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 事件型数据产品必须有 event_id、event_type、event_time</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>层级 3：语义标准（Semantic Interoperability）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  强烈建议，可豁免（需审批）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 全局词汇表中定义的核心实体名称</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - customer_id、order_id 等跨域 ID 的编码规范</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>层级 4：行为标准（Behavioral Interoperability）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  建议，领域自决</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - SLO 定义格式（建议使用 OpenSLO 规范）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 数据契约格式</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"全局词汇表-global-glossary-维护\">全局词汇表（Global Glossary）维护</h2><p>全局词汇表是减少跨域语义歧义的关键工具，也是联邦治理委员会的核心产出之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"词汇表条目结构\">词汇表条目结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# glossary/entities/customer.yaml&#10;term: &#39;Customer&#39;&#10;aliases: [&#39;user&#39;, &#39;member&#39;, &#39;account&#39;, &#39;buyer&#39;]&#10;definition: &#39;在本平台上完成注册并具有消费能力的主体&#39;&#10;owner: &#39;User Domain&#39;&#10;canonical_id_field: &#39;customer_id&#39;&#10;id_format: &#39;UUID v4&#39;&#10;last_updated: &#39;2026-03-15&#39;&#10;related_terms: [&#39;Guest&#39;, &#39;B2B Account&#39;, &#39;Anonymous User&#39;]&#10;boundary_note: &gt;&#10;  Guest（未注册访客）不属于 Customer；&#10;  B2B Account 是特殊 Customer 子类型，有独立 schema 扩展；&#10;  一个 Customer 可能有多个支付账号（PaymentAccount）。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># glossary/entities/customer.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">term</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Customer'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">aliases</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'member'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'account'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'buyer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">definition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'在本平台上完成注册并具有消费能力的主体'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'User Domain'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">canonical_id_field</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'customer_id'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id_format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UUID v4'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">last_updated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-03-15'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">related_terms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Guest'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'B2B Account'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Anonymous User'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">boundary_note</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  Guest（未注册访客）不属于 Customer；</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  B2B Account 是特殊 Customer 子类型，有独立 schema 扩展；</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  一个 Customer 可能有多个支付账号（PaymentAccount）。</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"词汇表治理流程\">词汇表治理流程</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>提案</strong>：任何领域 DPO 可提交新术语或修改现有术语</li>\n<li><strong>评审</strong>：治理委员会在两周内审查，检查是否与现有术语冲突</li>\n<li><strong>公告期</strong>：新术语接受期（14 天），任何领域可提出异议</li>\n<li><strong>生效</strong>：词汇表更新，Schema Registry 推送通知</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"互操作性的技术支撑\">互操作性的技术支撑</h2><h3 id=\"schema-registry\">Schema Registry</h3><p>Schema Registry 是存储和管理数据产品 schema 版本的中央注册服务：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>版本存储</td>\n<td>存储每个数据产品所有历史 schema 版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兼容性检查</td>\n<td>发布新版本前检查与前版本的兼容性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更通知</td>\n<td>Schema 变更时通知所有注册的下游消费者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略执行</td>\n<td>检查 schema 是否符合全局结构策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实现选择：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Confluent Schema Registry</strong>：与 Kafka 深度集成，支持 Avro/Protobuf/JSON Schema</li>\n<li><strong>AWS Glue Schema Registry</strong>：AWS 原生，与 MSK/Kinesis 集成</li>\n<li><strong>Apicurio Registry</strong>：开源，支持多种 artifact 类型</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"数据契约-data-contract\">数据契约（Data Contract）</h3><p>数据契约是上下游数据产品之间的正式协议，机器可读，可自动验证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# data-contracts/order-events-v2.yaml&#10;dataContractSpecification: 0.9.3&#10;id: &#39;order-events-contract-v2&#39;&#10;info:&#10;  title: &#39;Order Events Data Contract&#39;&#10;  version: &#39;2.1.0&#39;&#10;  owner: &#39;Order Domain&#39;&#10;  description: &#39;订单域事件流的消费契约&#39;&#10;&#10;servers:&#10;  kafka-prod:&#10;    type: kafka&#10;    host: &#39;kafka.internal:9092&#39;&#10;    topic: &#39;order.events.v2&#39;&#10;    format: avro&#10;&#10;terms:&#10;  usage: &#39;允许用于分析、ML 特征和下游聚合&#39;&#10;  limitations: &#39;禁止直接暴露给外部客户&#39;&#10;  billing: &#39;免费内部使用&#39;&#10;&#10;models:&#10;  OrderEvent:&#10;    description: &#39;订单生命周期事件&#39;&#10;    fields:&#10;      order_id:&#10;        type: UUID&#10;        required: true&#10;      event_type:&#10;        type: string&#10;        enum: [&#39;order_created&#39;, &#39;order_paid&#39;, &#39;order_shipped&#39;, &#39;order_cancelled&#39;]&#10;        required: true&#10;      event_time:&#10;        type: timestamp_tz&#10;        required: true&#10;        description: &#39;事件发生时间，ISO 8601&#39;&#10;&#10;servicelevels:&#10;  availability: &#39;99.9%&#39;&#10;  freshness:&#10;    description: &#39;事件延迟 &lt; 30s&#39;&#10;    threshold: &#39;PT30S&#39;&#10;  quality:&#10;    description: &#39;数据完整性 &gt; 99.5%&#39;&#10;    threshold: &#39;0.995&#39;&#10;&#10;quality:&#10;  type: SodaCL&#10;  specification: |&#10;    checks for OrderEvent:&#10;      - missing_count(order_id) = 0&#10;      - duplicate_count(order_id, event_time) &lt; 10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># data-contracts/order-events-v2.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dataContractSpecification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.9.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-events-contract-v2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">info</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Order Events Data Contract'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2.1.0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  owner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Order Domain'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'订单域事件流的消费契约'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">servers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  kafka-prod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kafka</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'kafka.internal:9092'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    topic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order.events.v2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">avro</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">terms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  usage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'允许用于分析、ML 特征和下游聚合'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  limitations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'禁止直接暴露给外部客户'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  billing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'免费内部使用'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">models</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  OrderEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'订单生命周期事件'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    fields</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UUID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      event_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order_created'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order_paid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order_shipped'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order_cancelled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      event_time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">timestamp_tz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        required</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'事件发生时间，ISO 8601'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">servicelevels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  availability</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'99.9%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  freshness</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'事件延迟 &#x3C; 30s'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    threshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PT30S'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  quality</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'数据完整性 > 99.5%'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    threshold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0.995'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">quality</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SodaCL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  specification</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    checks for OrderEvent:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      - missing_count(order_id) = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      - duplicate_count(order_id, event_time) &#x3C; 10</span></span></code></pre></div><p>数据契约管理工具：<strong>Data Contract CLI</strong>（<code>datacontract-cli</code>）提供契约的 lint、测试和发布功能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>联邦治理（Federated Governance）</strong></td>\n<td>全局策略统一定义、本地领域自治执行的治理架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>策略即代码（Policy as Code）</strong></td>\n<td>将治理策略编码为机器可执行的检查规则（OPA Rego、GE 等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>规范数据模型（Canonical Data Model）</strong></td>\n<td>所有数据产品输出映射的全局统一实体模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>防腐层（Anti-Corruption Layer）</strong></td>\n<td>在数据产品边界做语义转换，隔离上游模型变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>共享内核（Shared Kernel）</strong></td>\n<td>多个领域共享的最小公共数据约定（ID 编码规范等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>数据契约（Data Contract）</strong></td>\n<td>上下游数据产品之间机器可读的正式协议，包含 schema 和 SLO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Schema Registry</strong></td>\n<td>存储和管理数据产品 schema 版本的中央注册服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>全局词汇表（Global Glossary）</strong></td>\n<td>定义跨领域共享术语语义的权威字典</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>联邦治理的核心价值是在分布式所有权下保持全局一致性。实现路径：策略即代码保证全局策略的自动执行；Schema Registry 管理接口版本演进；数据契约将上下游约定机器可读化；全局词汇表消除语义歧义。互操作性标准应分层（语法→结构→语义→行为），越底层越强制，越高层越灵活，避免强制规范成为新的中央瓶颈。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[联邦治理委员会] --&gt;|制定| B[全局策略]&#10;    B --&gt;|策略即代码| C[CI/CD 自动检查]&#10;    A --&gt;|维护| D[全局词汇表]&#10;    D --&gt;|语义对齐| E[数据产品 Schema]&#10;    E --&gt;|注册| F[Schema Registry]&#10;    F --&gt;|版本管理| G[数据契约]&#10;    G --&gt;|自动验证| H[跨域互操作性]\">graph TD\n    A[联邦治理委员会] --&gt;|制定| B[全局策略]\n    B --&gt;|策略即代码| C[CI/CD 自动检查]\n    A --&gt;|维护| D[全局词汇表]\n    D --&gt;|语义对齐| E[数据产品 Schema]\n    E --&gt;|注册| F[Schema Registry]\n    F --&gt;|版本管理| G[数据契约]\n    G --&gt;|自动验证| H[跨域互操作性]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"联邦治理与互操作性标准","id":"联邦治理与互操作性标准"},{"level":2,"text":"联邦治理架构","id":"联邦治理架构"},{"level":3,"text":"治理层级模型","id":"治理层级模型"},{"level":3,"text":"跨域治理委员会（Federated Governance Council）","id":"跨域治理委员会-federated-governance-council"},{"level":2,"text":"策略即代码（Policy as Code）","id":"策略即代码-policy-as-code"},{"level":3,"text":"策略类型与编码方式","id":"策略类型与编码方式"},{"level":3,"text":"策略执行流水线","id":"策略执行流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"互操作性标准","id":"互操作性标准"},{"level":3,"text":"规范模型 vs 防腐层 vs 共享内核","id":"规范模型-vs-防腐层-vs-共享内核"},{"level":3,"text":"实践推荐：分层互操作标准","id":"实践推荐-分层互操作标准"},{"level":2,"text":"全局词汇表（Global Glossary）维护","id":"全局词汇表-global-glossary-维护"},{"level":3,"text":"词汇表条目结构","id":"词汇表条目结构"},{"level":3,"text":"词汇表治理流程","id":"词汇表治理流程"},{"level":2,"text":"互操作性的技术支撑","id":"互操作性的技术支撑"},{"level":3,"text":"Schema Registry","id":"schema-registry"},{"level":3,"text":"数据契约（Data Contract）","id":"数据契约-data-contract"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"领域建模与数据 Ownership 映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/principles/domain-modeling-ownership"},"next":{"title":"数据产品规格设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/architecture/data-product-spec"}}